(text "Nominal backup: commonUV5.810V/4Sbackup11.070V postreversebarrier; railOV8.973V.\nController operational endpoint remains6.0/12.0V with hysteresis; cell-group BMS external.\nLocal pack sensing does not prove weakest-cell voltage. Hysteresis implemented by fault latch;\nrearm only after input exceeds qualified margin. Fox-only: watt guards DNP, R228 clamps PA_GUARD_RAW; UV comparator remains local." (at 175 244 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e934f3bb-cf93-5db6-9b5f-863104c1846a"))
